        "TileImage": "$($repository ea78934c-b58f-4490-9c20-727a4cf17db4).Image",
        "Description": "From what we&apos;ve learned, this organisation is still rather small. But that doesn&apos;t make them less of a threat. They focus on enraging people, so they can do the work for them.\r\rTheir goals still aren&apos;t clear to us, but it doesn&apos;t have greater matter at this point.\r\rYour job now is to eliminate their group of main operatives, before they eliminate some Italian politic which again, may result in another protests.\r\rGood Luck 47. Hopefully after them we will find their leaders.",
